Thanks for doing it.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.340
Absolutely.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.740
One of the reasons why I brought you in here,

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:12.740
I think everybody that has become politically active since,

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:14.340
let's say, 2015,

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:17.040
because there was a lot of stuff that happened in Occupy.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.540
But I think a large group of people

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:23.640
that had previously never sniffed the world of politics

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:27.540
came alive when Bernie Sanders ran in 2015

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.640
against Hillary Clinton.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.240
Then we saw the Donald Trump regime.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.840
Then we saw Bernie run again.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:37.740
Joe Biden was selected by the Democratic Party.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:41.040
And I think a lot of people have been through the mill

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:44.740
watching their hearts desires and their dreams

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:50.140
and their hopes get smashed along the rocky shores of democracy.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.240
And I think people just genuinely believe

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.340
that this is just the way it is

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:56.540
and that there is no alternative

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:00.540
and that people are otherwise just assuming

