00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:05.240
And part of that is not by accident.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.040
Part of that is the stuff that goes on behind the scenes

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.040
by unelected bureaucrats

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.640
and other spy-like agencies

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.740
such as the CIA,

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:16.640
