00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:20.240
not just in the United States, but globally.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.740
In a prior interview with Chris Hedges

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:26.640
that was listened to or seen by nearly half million people,

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.240
one of the key things that you brought out

