not to take on the CIA

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:59.280
because he said they have nine ways from Sunday

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.980
for getting back at you.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.480
And so CNN had me on and they wanted to know

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.380
what he meant by that.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:11.580
And I said, well, it's not November 22nd, 1963

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.480
because that's what people were jumping up

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.080
and shouting about.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:19.380
What it was was you look at presidents.

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:23.780
Presidents are only president for four years or eight years.

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:29.480
People at the CIA are there for 25, 30, 35 years.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.780
They're unelected.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:34.480
There's no accountability to pretty much anyone.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:37.980
And they know that they can outweigh presidents.

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:40.380
If there's a president that they don't like

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:42.580
like Donald Trump,

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.180
they don't have to do what he says.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:48.180
They just slow roll whatever orders come from the White House

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.880
and end up at Langley.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:52.780
If they don't want to do a covert action program,

