00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:13.180
Wait until you see this blue border report

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:16.780
that's classified at four levels above top secret

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:21.080
or black border report that's eyes only for the president.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.980
And you've sort of sucked them in

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.880
to this little club that we all had

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:32.180
where this stuff is so important and so secret

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:34.180
that nobody else can know about it.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.580
Isn't it cool?

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.380
Isn't it great to be one of us now?

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.580
And you've done it.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.380
You've sucked them in.

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.180
And as it ends up,

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.680
there are the ones running foreign policy,

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.280
not the president.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:51.580
There are the ones telling elected overseers on Capitol Hill

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:53.380
how things are going to be,

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.880
not the overseers themselves.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.580
The CIA is very, very good

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.580
doing this kind of thing.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.280
They've been doing it really since the 60s,

