00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.480
Now, the story that you opened with

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:10.780
I think is an important one

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.280
and it bears a little bit of explanation.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:14.880
When I got out of prison,

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.680
I ran into this senator at a dinner party

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.780
and I went up to him and I said,

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:20.980
hey senator, I gotta say,

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.380
I was disappointed that you didn't come out

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.780
in support of me.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.280
You should have been,

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:28.680
in my view, a natural ally.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.280
He got very angry.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.080
He got right in my face about it.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.580
He goes, look,

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.180
it took all of my energy

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.480
just to not lose my security clearance.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:43.380
And boy, that just made everything so clear to me.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:44.780
Here you are,

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.980
one of the senior most members

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:49.680
of the Senate Intelligence Committee.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.480
You're supposed to be the boss,

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:55.080
the one overseeing the CIA

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.880
and you are afraid of them.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.280
You're afraid that because you came down

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.580
on a certain side of a political issue,

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:07.080
they're going to take your security clearance away.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:08.580
That's just cowardice,

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.380
but it also goes to show you

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.480
the long arm of the CIA.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.280
I've been doing a lot of research

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:18.480
on everything from the Bolshevik Revolution

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.580
to present,

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:22.080
largely focusing recently

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:25.280
on what happened post World War Two

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:27.680
and the effects of combating

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:30.680
then what they saw as Joseph Stalin's

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:33.380
empire building desires

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.980
and the act of trying to counter communism

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.880
became everything.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.280
You already had McCarthy.

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.680
You had so many things

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:45.680
that it becomes so toxic to society.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:48.380
But I think this is not the beginning

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:49.080
of the deep state,

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:50.680
but I think this is the beginning

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:54.280
of seeing it in its nascent state,

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:57.480
Truman battling with MacArthur

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.380
and MacArthur wanting to take

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:01.580
the Korean War into China,

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:02.680
into Russia,

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.580
willing to do whatever it could

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:05.980
to put the death stake

