into the private sector and I still waited for somebody

00:27:46.870 --> 00:27:50.570
to come out and say look the CIA is torturing people.

00:27:50.570 --> 00:27:52.170
Nobody did.

00:27:52.170 --> 00:27:56.970
In December of 2007 Brian Ross called me from ABC News

00:27:56.970 --> 00:27:59.070
and I knew Brian Ross by reputation.

00:27:59.070 --> 00:28:03.370
The guy won 14 Emmy Awards and was one of the greatest

00:28:03.370 --> 00:28:06.870
investigative journalists in America and he said he had

00:28:06.870 --> 00:28:10.370
a source who said that I had tortured Abu Zubeda.

00:28:10.370 --> 00:28:12.970
I said that was absolutely untrue.

00:28:12.970 --> 00:28:17.170
I was the only person who was kind to Abu Zubeda.

00:28:17.170 --> 00:28:20.370
I said I never laid a hand on him or on any other prisoner.

00:28:20.370 --> 00:28:25.170
I said your source is either misinformed or he's a liar

00:28:25.170 --> 00:28:27.770
and he said well you're welcome to come on the show

00:28:27.770 --> 00:28:29.170
and defend yourself.

00:28:29.170 --> 00:28:31.770
I had no idea that was a reporter's trick because

00:28:31.770 --> 00:28:36.370
I had never spoken to a reporter before.

00:28:36.370 --> 00:28:40.170
Well a couple of days after he asked me

00:28:40.170 --> 00:28:44.970
President George W. Bush gave a press conference in which

00:28:44.970 --> 00:28:49.370
he was asked about torture and he looked right in the camera

00:28:49.370 --> 00:28:55.470
Steve and he said we do not torture like that.

00:28:55.470 --> 00:28:59.070
I happened to be sitting on the couch with my then wife.

00:28:59.070 --> 00:29:02.570
She was also a senior CIA officer and I looked at her

00:29:02.570 --> 00:29:06.770
and I said he is a bald faced liar.

00:29:06.770 --> 00:29:11.370
Now at the time on the strength of the Abu Zubeda capture

00:29:11.370 --> 00:29:16.970
I had been promoted to be the executive assistant to the CIA's deputy director

00:29:16.970 --> 00:29:22.470
and so I'm seeing everything that the CIA is doing everywhere in the world.

00:29:22.470 --> 00:29:26.870
That's my job to keep the deputy director informed.

00:29:26.870 --> 00:29:30.470
So this made me angry this statement by Bush this black

00:29:30.470 --> 00:29:35.370
and white lie that we don't torture a few days after that

00:29:35.370 --> 00:29:37.170
it's a Friday.

00:29:37.170 --> 00:29:40.070
And he's walking from the South Portico of the White House

00:29:40.070 --> 00:29:43.370
to get onto the helicopter to fly to Camp David

00:29:43.370 --> 00:29:46.770
and a reporter shouts a question at him about torture

00:29:46.770 --> 00:29:50.270
and he turns and he says well if there is torture

00:29:50.270 --> 00:29:53.770
it's because of a rogue CIA officer.

00:29:53.770 --> 00:29:57.870
And I told my wife Brian Ross's source is at the White House

00:29:57.870 --> 00:30:11.550
and they're going to try to pin this on me.

