00:31:02.430 --> 00:31:05.730
So I called Brian Ross back and I said I'll give you

00:31:05.730 --> 00:31:08.630
your interview and I decided in the days between that phone

00:31:08.630 --> 00:31:12.330
call and the interview itself that no matter what he asked me

00:31:12.330 --> 00:31:16.430
I was going to tell the truth because I believed that this whole

00:31:16.430 --> 00:31:19.230
program was illegal.

00:31:19.230 --> 00:31:23.530
And so in December 2007 I think it was the 11th to the best

00:31:23.530 --> 00:31:25.830
of my recollection.

00:31:25.830 --> 00:31:30.630
I went on ABC News in a nationally televised interview

00:31:30.630 --> 00:31:33.230
and I said three things that just changed the course of

00:31:33.230 --> 00:31:34.630
the rest of my life.

00:31:34.630 --> 00:31:38.030
I said that the CIA was torturing its prisoners.

00:31:38.030 --> 00:31:42.030
I said that torture was official US government policy.

00:31:42.030 --> 00:31:46.130
It was not the result of a rogue and I said that the policy

00:31:46.130 --> 00:31:50.630
had been personally approved by the president himself.

00:31:50.630 --> 00:31:56.130
As you might imagine within 24 hours the CIA filed a criminal

00:31:56.130 --> 00:31:58.830
complaint against me with the Justice Department asking that

00:31:58.830 --> 00:32:02.730
I be arrested for exposing classified information.

00:32:02.730 --> 00:32:06.130
The FBI began investigating me and they investigated me for

00:32:06.130 --> 00:32:11.430
a full year from December of 2007 to December of 2008.

00:32:11.430 --> 00:32:15.030
And then in December 2008 they sent my attorney a letter

00:32:15.030 --> 00:32:18.030
called the declination letter saying that they had

00:32:18.030 --> 00:32:21.930
investigated me and they were declining to prosecute

00:32:21.930 --> 00:32:24.030
because I had not violated the law.

00:32:24.030 --> 00:32:30.030
The truth is it is illegal in this country to classify

00:32:30.030 --> 00:32:31.630
a crime.

00:32:31.630 --> 00:32:35.630
If you're committing a crime you can't make that program

00:32:35.630 --> 00:32:38.830
classified for the purpose of keeping it from the American

00:32:38.830 --> 00:32:39.430
people.

00:32:40.730 --> 00:32:43.030
So I hadn't committed a crime.

00:32:44.130 --> 00:32:47.730
Four weeks later Barack Obama takes the oath of office

00:32:47.730 --> 00:32:51.330
as president and there's talk that he's going to name

00:32:51.330 --> 00:32:56.330
John Brennan an old nemesis of mine from the CIA as the

00:32:56.330 --> 00:32:57.330
CIA director.

