In fact progressives were up in arms about that and

00:33:01.030 --> 00:33:04.130
Brennan had to wait four years for the second term to become

00:33:04.130 --> 00:33:07.330
CIA director but for the first term he became the deputy

00:33:07.330 --> 00:33:10.830
