00:33:10.830 --> 00:33:15.230
asked the Justice Department to secretly reopen the case

00:33:15.230 --> 00:33:15.930
against me.

00:33:16.630 --> 00:33:19.830
We learned in discovery later that Brennan sent Eric Holder

00:33:19.830 --> 00:33:23.430
a letter and he said charge him with espionage.

00:33:24.630 --> 00:33:27.630
And Holder wrote back and said my people don't think

00:33:27.630 --> 00:33:29.030
