00:33:29.930 --> 00:33:32.830
And then Brennan wrote back and said charge him anyway and

00:33:32.830 --> 00:33:34.130
make him defend himself.

00:33:34.530 --> 00:33:39.730
Wow I had no idea that my phones were tapped for the next

00:33:39.730 --> 00:33:44.430
three years that I was being followed by teams of FBI

00:33:44.430 --> 00:33:48.930
agents that every one of my emails was being intercepted

00:33:49.730 --> 00:33:53.230
and then finally in January of 2012 I was arrested

00:33:54.130 --> 00:33:58.430
and charged with five felonies including three counts of

00:33:58.430 --> 00:34:04.330
espionage for speaking to ABC News and later on speaking

00:34:04.330 --> 00:34:05.330
to the New York Times.

00:34:06.430 --> 00:34:08.930
Now they knew I hadn't committed espionage and those espionage

00:34:08.930 --> 00:34:12.930
charges were dropped eventually but not until I went bankrupt

00:34:14.430 --> 00:34:16.930
and it's not because I was special in any way they do

00:34:16.930 --> 00:34:17.730
this to everybody.

00:34:18.430 --> 00:34:20.930
They do something called charge stacking where they

00:34:20.930 --> 00:34:23.730
charge you with as many felonies as they possibly can

00:34:24.730 --> 00:34:27.430
and then they come back and say if you take a plea

00:34:27.430 --> 00:34:30.230
to this lesser charge we'll drop everything else.

00:34:31.130 --> 00:34:33.430
So I was facing 45 years in prison.

00:34:34.630 --> 00:34:38.630
Their final offer was 30 months of which I would serve 23

00:34:39.230 --> 00:34:41.530
and it's funny they made their best and final offer

00:34:42.330 --> 00:34:44.930
and they said I had until noon the next day to give them

00:34:44.930 --> 00:34:47.530
an answer and my wife and I stayed up all night long

00:34:47.930 --> 00:34:50.130
debating what to do and I decided to turn it down.

00:34:50.830 --> 00:34:54.330
I naively said that once I get in front of a jury

00:34:54.330 --> 00:34:56.330
